Package: footBayes
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Statistical Framework for Single-Molecule Footprinting Data Analysis
Date: 2025-05-16
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Evgeniy A.", family = "Ozonov",
                  email = "evgeniy.ozonov@fmi.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: footBayes implements a Bayesian probabilistic framework for the
    analysis of single-molecule footprinting (SMF) data from any SMF assay,
    including NOMe-seq, SAMOSA, Fiber-seq, DAF-seq, FOODIE, and other
    methyltransferase-based footprinting technologies. The package provides
    statistical inference of footprint spectra, per-molecule footprint
    prediction and genome-wide enrichment scoring.
